<title>USA: Moore Corp renames its U.S. unit.</title>
<headline>Moore Corp renames its U.S. unit.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST, Ill. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moore Corp Ltd said on Monday it renamed its Moore Business Forms Inc subsidiary as Moore USA Inc.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the Canadian business communications company said the name change reflects the evolving nature of Moore's business. Four operations under the Moore USA umbrella will also change their names, although four others will not.</p>
<p>Moore makes and designs business communications products. Its stock was down 1/4 Monday afternoon at 20-1/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
